 "notes": "Armory modal, Relics tab selected (tab.relics has the lit gold frame with diamond finials and a warm label; the other tabs are idle navy with grey labels). Header subtitle 'SQUAD 5 / 6' is split into a caption and a dynamic count (the concept's word spacing is wider than Cinzel's). Left: framed collection panel with a 'Collection' title bar and an 'All' filter dropdown, a 3x3 grid of relic cards (pennant-shaped corner plate with a category glyph, item picture, centred name caption), a gold scrollbar with the thumb at the top (more rows below), and a navy BACK button with a chevron (BACK is drawn in uniform capitals here, unlike the spells screen's 'Back'). card.1.0 (Spectral Lantern) is selected: orange glowing frame, so its rect is the glow-frame edge and 1-2 px larger than the other cards. All other cards are idle; nothing is locked or equipped-marked. Card sizes are slightly irregular in the concept: columns 120/118/117 wide, rows 132/131/125 tall (the bottom row is shorter). Centre: preview well with the selected relic on a pedestal and prev/next chevrons. Right: detail card = dark title bar (lantern icon plate + 'Spectral Lantern') over a parchment body with a two-line dark description and a dark inset stats panel of three rows (icon, thin gold vertical divider at x 963-964, value over caption): +24% Damage, -4% Cooldown, EPIC Rarity. Below are two full-width buttons: EQUIP (navy, helmet icon, light label) and FORGE (gold, primary, crossed-hammers icon, dark label). Equip/Forge use Cinzel small caps (initial about 2 px taller); the concept's FORGE letters are narrower than Cinzel's, so the width-fitted size draws them about 3 px short."
